---
// TripCraft 여행 단위 잠금. "잠금 없이 / 여행 단위 잠금" 두 상태를 버튼으로 바꿔 본다.
---

<figure class="lockfig-wrap flex flex-col gap-4" data-mode="lock">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-md">
      두 사람이 같은 여행에 시간이 겹치는 일정을 동시에 넣습니다.
    </p>
    <div class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-gray-100 p-1 ring-1 ring-gray-200" role="group" aria-label="잠금 방식">
      <button type="button" data-mode="nolock" aria-pressed="false" class="lock-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600">잠금 없이</button>
      <button type="button" data-mode="lock" aria-pressed="true" class="lock-btn px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600">여행 단위 잠금</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <svg class="lockfig" viewBox="0 0 660 214" role="img" aria-label="잠금이 없으면 겹치는 두 일정이 모두 저장되고, 여행 단위 잠금이 있으면 두 번째 요청이 방금 저장된 일정을 보고 거절되는 흐름">
      <text x="0" y="16" class="t-muted t-small">요청 처리 순서 →</text>
      <text x="0" y="44" class="t-strong">A · 10–12시 박물관 추가</text>
      <text x="0" y="122" class="t-strong">B · 11–13시 시장 추가</text>
      <line x1="470" y1="8" x2="470" y2="206" class="s-grid"></line>
      <text x="490" y="16" class="t-muted t-small">저장된 일정표</text>
      <g class="s-grid">
        <line x1="520" y1="40" x2="656" y2="40"></line><line x1="520" y1="80" x2="656" y2="80"></line>
        <line x1="520" y1="120" x2="656" y2="120"></line><line x1="520" y1="160" x2="656" y2="160"></line>
      </g>
      <text x="488" y="44" class="t-muted t-small">10시</text><text x="488" y="84" class="t-muted t-small">11시</text>
      <text x="488" y="124" class="t-muted t-small">12시</text><text x="488" y="164" class="t-muted t-small">13시</text>

      <g class="m-nolock">
        <rect x="0" y="54" width="150" height="26" rx="5" class="s-check"></rect><text x="10" y="71">겹침 검사 · 없음</text>
        <rect x="150" y="54" width="100" height="26" rx="5" class="s-save"></rect><text x="160" y="71" class="t-on">저장</text>
        <rect x="30" y="132" width="150" height="26" rx="5" class="s-check"></rect><text x="40" y="149">겹침 검사 · 없음</text>
        <rect x="180" y="132" width="100" height="26" rx="5" class="s-save"></rect><text x="190" y="149" class="t-on">저장</text>
        <text x="0" y="192" class="t-bad">두 검사가 서로의 새 일정을 보지 못한 채 함께 통과합니다</text>
        <rect x="526" y="40" width="58" height="80" rx="5" class="s-blk-a"></rect><text x="533" y="58" class="t-small">박물관</text>
        <rect x="592" y="80" width="58" height="80" rx="5" class="s-blk-b"></rect><text x="599" y="98" class="t-small">시장</text>
        <rect x="520" y="80" width="136" height="40" class="s-over"></rect>
        <text x="488" y="192" class="t-bad">둘 다 저장 · 11–12시 겹침</text>
      </g>

      <g class="m-lock">
        <rect x="0" y="54" width="46" height="26" rx="5" class="s-lock"></rect><text x="9" y="71">잠금</text>
        <rect x="46" y="54" width="110" height="26" rx="5" class="s-check"></rect><text x="56" y="71">겹침 검사</text>
        <rect x="156" y="54" width="90" height="26" rx="5" class="s-save"></rect><text x="166" y="71" class="t-on">저장</text>
        <line x1="246" y1="48" x2="246" y2="168" class="s-tick"></line>
        <text x="252" y="44" class="t-small t-muted">A 저장 끝 · 잠금 풀림</text>
        <rect x="30" y="132" width="216" height="26" rx="5" class="s-wait"></rect><text x="40" y="149" class="t-muted">잠금 대기</text>
        <rect x="246" y="132" width="110" height="26" rx="5" class="s-check"></rect><text x="256" y="149">겹침 검사</text>
        <rect x="356" y="132" width="60" height="26" rx="5" class="s-rej"></rect><text x="368" y="149" class="t-bad">거절</text>
        <text x="246" y="176" class="t-small t-muted">방금 저장된 A 일정을 봅니다</text>
        <text x="0" y="206" class="t-good">한 여행 안에서는 한 사람씩 차례로 저장합니다</text>
        <rect x="526" y="40" width="58" height="80" rx="5" class="s-blk-a"></rect><text x="533" y="58" class="t-small">박물관</text>
        <rect x="592" y="80" width="58" height="80" rx="5" class="s-ghost"></rect><text x="599" y="98" class="t-small t-muted">시장</text>
        <text x="488" y="192" class="t-good">겹침 없음 · B는 다시 고름</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .lockfig { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 34rem; height: auto; }
  .lockfig text { fill: #1f2937; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; }
  .lockfig .t-strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .lockfig .t-muted { fill: #6b7280; }
  .lockfig .t-small { font-size: 11px; }
  .lockfig .t-on { fill: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }
  .lockfig .t-bad { fill: #be123c; font-weight: 600; }
  .lockfig .t-good { fill: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .lockfig .s-check { fill: #f3f4f6; stroke: #9ca3af; }
  .lockfig .s-save { fill: var(--accent); stroke: var(--accent); }
  .lockfig .s-lock { fill: #fef3c7; stroke: #d97706; }
  .lockfig .s-wait { fill: #fffbeb; stroke: #d97706; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .lockfig .s-rej { fill: #ffe4e6; stroke: #e11d48; }
  .lockfig .s-grid { stroke: #e5e7eb; fill: none; }
  .lockfig .s-blk-a { fill: #dbeafe; stroke: var(--accent); }
  .lockfig .s-blk-b { fill: #e0e7ff; stroke: #4f46e5; }
  .lockfig .s-ghost { fill: none; stroke: #e11d48; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .lockfig .s-over { fill: #e11d48; opacity: 0.22; }
  .lockfig .s-tick { stroke: #374151; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 2 3; }
  .lockfig-wrap[data-mode="nolock"] .m-lock,
  .lockfig-wrap[data-mode="lock"] .m-nolock { display: none; }
  .lock-btn[aria-pressed="true"] { background: #ffffff; color: #111827; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .lockfig g { animation: lockfade 0.3s ease; }
  }
  @keyframes lockfade { from { opacity: 0.3; } to { opacity: 1; } }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".lockfig-wrap").forEach((wrap) => {
    const btns = wrap.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".lock-btn");
    btns.forEach((b) =>
      b.addEventListener("click", () => {
        wrap.dataset.mode = b.dataset.mode;
        btns.forEach((o) => o.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(o === b)));
      }),
    );
  });
</script>
